---
title: "liquidate_adl_borrow (Current Finance: Auto-Deleverage)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_pre_check: pre_liquidation_check(app, cap, market, adl_permission)
    q_pre_check --> q_check_collateral: assert collateral can_be_collateral
    q_check_collateral --> q_load_adl: load TimeLock from adl_registry.borrows[emode][debt_type]
    q_load_adl --> q_accrue: accrue_interest for debt asset
    q_accrue --> q_check_limit: ensure_limit_breached(total_debt gt target_amount)
    q_check_limit --> q_calc_time: secs_since_activation = clock_now - timelock.timestamp
    q_calc_time --> q_calc_ltv: ltv = base - hourly_drop * hours
    q_calc_ltv --> q_calc_incentive: incentive = base + daily_penalty * days
    q_calc_incentive --> q_cap_incentive: incentive = min(adl_incentive, normal_incentive)
    q_cap_incentive --> q_build_params: LiquidationParams with overridden ltv and incentive
    q_build_params --> q_liquidation_inner: liquidation_inner(...)
    q_liquidation_inner --> q_post: post_liquidation + transfer
    q_post --> [*]

    note right of q_calc_ltv
        INV-001: ADL activates only when total_debt exceeds target_amount
        INV-002: ltv threshold decreases hourly (saturating_sub prevents underflow)
        INV-003: liquidation_incentive increases daily, capped at normal incentive
        INV-004: ADL auto-deactivates when debt drops below target_amount
        INV-005: revenue_factor is zero for ADL (no protocol fee on ADL liquidations)
    end note
